gp-arcade-input 0
# A second, longer MAME oracle capture of Tapper (gp-arcade's milestone 1):
# attract mode, a coin, start 1, then three minutes of play that serves
# a few drinks, moves between bars, runs along a bar and mostly lets the
# customers through, so lives are lost and the game ends; then a second
# coin and game. 30 frames a second.
system rbtapper
columns CSRLDUT
